 I do not see a security problem with it, and clients that care for the per=
formance didn&#39;t seem to need explicit permission anyway.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u></u>=C2=A0<u></u></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal">Best,</p>
</div>
<div>
