&gt;&gt; <br>
&gt;&gt;=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0From a technical perspective I&#39;d lik=
e to revisit this point. My memory is that the<br>
&gt;&gt;=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0plausible KEMs actually have fast key ge=
neration, as does EC. Why not just<br>
&gt;&gt;=C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0keep the requirement as-is?<br>
